# Environment for the shared ColBERT sidecar (just colbert-up / rag-services-up).
# Copy to ~/.config/lukleh/besedy/rag-services.env, or point BESEDY_RAG_SERVICES_ENV
# at another path outside the checkout. Keep it out of git.

# Index the sidecar loads before it reports healthy, as a path inside the
# container: the host's ~/.local/state/lukleh/besedy/tmp/rag_colbert is mounted
# at /data/state/rag_colbert. Fill in the placeholders and uncomment. Point it
# at the `index` symlink, not an `index_<timestamp>` folder: each index update
# moves the symlink, so a restart warms the active build. Unset, the sidecar
# logs that no preload is configured and the first search loads the index.
# COLBERT_PRELOAD_INDEX_DIR=/data/state/rag_colbert/<workflow_group_id>/<backend_slug>/<chunk_version>/<model_slug>/index/colbert_index
